WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Review the measured change before applying it.

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:04.050
Apply records a Receipt and clears this pending change.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.800
Refresh captures a new Baseline; Parse all words separately updates the numbers.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.800
The latest Assessment is published, with updated results in the Overview.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:09.450
Timing shows the recorded parse measurements for the Selection.
